// Graphics written the way real labels write them: an unqualified storage name, which
// a printer defaults to R:STAMP.GRF, and the row compression a driver emits. One stamp
// is recalled twice, one is recalled but never downloaded (it lives in printer memory
// from an earlier job), which is the shape the Atak corpus has.
~DGSTAMP,24,3,FFFFFF:F00003:::::F00003:FFFFFF
^XA
^CI28
^PW400
^LL300
^FO40,40^A0N,30,30^FDShort name graphics^FS
^FO40,100^XGSTAMP,1,1^FS
^FO40,180^XGSTAMP,1,1^FS
^FO200,180^XGCARIMBO,1,1^FS
^XZ
